
  <main id="main">

    <section class="page-head industry-head">
      <div class="container">
        <span class="eyebrow">Website design · East London, Eastern Cape</span>
        <h1>Websites for East London and Buffalo City businesses.</h1>
        <p class="lead">From Beacon Bay to Mdantsane, East London customers look businesses up on their phones first. A clear, fast website makes sure what they find is you.</p>
        <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top:1.4rem">
          <button type="button" class="btn btn--primary btn--large" data-mockup-open data-mockup-hint="e.g. Gonubie Beach Café — breakfasts and coffee, WhatsApp orders">Get a free mockup of your site</button>
          <a href="#pricing" class="btn btn--ghost btn--large">See what it costs</a>
        </div>
        <p class="hero__freebie"><span class="hero__freebie-tag">Free</span> We build a preview of your site first: no deposit, no obligation. Websites from R1,000, with a fixed quote before you pay anything.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="whyTitle">
      <div class="container service__grid">
        <div class="reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">Why it matters in East London</span>
          <h2 id="whyTitle">Your next customer is searching right now.</h2>
          <p class="lead" style="font-size:1.05rem">Many East London businesses rely on regular customers and word of mouth, which works until someone new moves to the area or searches for what you do. A simple website and a well set-up Google profile bring in those new customers, and give your regulars an easy way to share your details.</p>
        </div>
        <aside class="card card--tint reveal">
          <h3>What people in East London type into Google</h3>
          <div class="area-searches"><span class="area-search"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 21s-7-6.2-7-11.5A7 7 0 0 1 19 9.5C19 14.8 12 21 12 21z"/><circle cx="12" cy="9.5" r="2.5"/></svg>"plumber East London"</span><span class="area-search"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 21s-7-6.2-7-11.5A7 7 0 0 1 19 9.5C19 14.8 12 21 12 21z"/><circle cx="12" cy="9.5" r="2.5"/></svg>"salon Beacon Bay"</span><span class="area-search"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 21s-7-6.2-7-11.5A7 7 0 0 1 19 9.5C19 14.8 12 21 12 21z"/><circle cx="12" cy="9.5" r="2.5"/></svg>"takeaway Vincent"</span></div>
          <p class="small muted" style="margin-top:0.8rem">A website that names your area, plus a Google profile with the right service area, is how you show up for searches like these.</p>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section--tint" aria-labelledby="whoTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head reveal"><span class="eyebrow">Who we build for</span><h2 id="whoTitle">Websites for East London's small businesses.</h2></div>
        <div class="grid grid--2">
          <a class="card card--link reveal" href="for-plumbers"><h3>Trades and services</h3><p>Found on Google across Buffalo City, with tap-to-call and WhatsApp.</p><div class="card__foot"><span class="card__more">See what we build</span></div></a>
          <a class="card card--link reveal" href="for-salons"><h3>Salons and beauty</h3><p>Booking, prices and a gallery of your real work.</p><div class="card__foot"><span class="card__more">See what we build</span></div></a>
          <a class="card card--link reveal" href="for-restaurants"><h3>Restaurants and takeaways</h3><p>Menus and WhatsApp orders that work on any phone.</p><div class="card__foot"><span class="card__more">See what we build</span></div></a>
          <div class="card reveal"><h3>Suppliers to industry</h3><p>A professional site for businesses that supply larger companies.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="howTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head reveal"><span class="eyebrow">Fully online</span><h2 id="howTitle">No office visits needed: it all happens on your phone.</h2></div>
        <ol class="steps reveal">
          <li class="step"><span class="step__num">1</span><h3>Tell us on WhatsApp</h3><p>A few lines about your business, or the 30-second form. No meetings, no travel, wherever you are in East London.</p></li>
          <li class="step"><span class="step__num">2</span><h3>Free mockup on your phone</h3><p>We build a preview of your site and send you the link, usually within 2 business days.</p></li>
          <li class="step"><span class="step__num">3</span><h3>Fixed quote, R500 deposit</h3><p>Like it? Accept the fixed quote online and pay the deposit by card. It comes off your total.</p></li>
          <li class="step"><span class="step__num">4</span><h3>Live, and looked after</h3><p>Quick sites go live in days. You own the domain; we host it and keep your Google profile up to date if you'd like.</p></li>
        </ol>
        <p class="small muted reveal" style="margin-top:1.2rem"><b>Areas we cover in and around East London:</b> Beacon Bay, Vincent, Gonubie, Nahoon, Mdantsane, Quigney, Berea, Cambridge, King William&#x27;s Town (Qonce), Amalinda, and everywhere else in South Africa.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="pricing" aria-labelledby="priceTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section__head reveal"><span class="eyebrow">What it costs</span><h2 id="priceTitle">The same fixed prices anywhere in South Africa.</h2></div>
        <div class="grid grid--2 industry-pricing">
          <ul class="price-list reveal">
            <li><div class="pl-name">Quick website<small>One page: services, prices, gallery, WhatsApp, Maps · live in about a day</small></div><span class="price"><small>from</small>R1,000</span></li>
            <li><div class="pl-name">Business website<small>4–5 pages, custom layout, contact form, gallery</small></div><span class="price"><small>from</small>R2,000</span></li>
            <li><div class="pl-name">Custom website<small>Booking, online shop, portals and integrations</small></div><span class="price"><small>from</small>R4,500</span></li>
            <li><div class="pl-name">Google profile setup<small>Claimed, verified and filled in, plus a review QR card</small></div><span class="price">R450</span></li>
            <li><div class="pl-name">Hosting &amp; care<small>Hosting from R50/month; Care (R100/month or R1,000/yr) adds small changes and your Google profile</small></div><span class="price"><small>from</small>R50<span class="per">/mo</span></span></li>
          </ul>
          <div class="card card--tint reveal">
            <h3>First year, all in</h3>
            <p>A quick website (R1,000) plus the first year of Care (R1,000: hosting, small changes and your Google profile looked after) is <strong>R2,000</strong>. Hosting only is R1,500. Accept the fixed quote online and pay the R500 deposit then; the balance is due on completion. Domain and any third-party fees are separate and agreed first.</p>
            <p class="small muted" style="margin-top:0.8rem">Prices are starting points. Your quote is fixed before we begin. <a class="inline-link" href="pricing">Full price list →</a></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section--tint" aria-labelledby="faqTitle">
      <div class="container container--narrow">
        <div class="section__head reveal"><span class="eyebrow">Questions from East London</span><h2 id="faqTitle">Straight answers.</h2></div>
        <div class="faq reveal">
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>Do you work with businesses in Qonce and Mdantsane?</summary><p>Yes, and anywhere else in South Africa. We work fully online, so the price and process are the same wherever you are.</p></details>
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>I&#x27;ve got a Facebook page. Isn&#x27;t that enough?</summary><p>Facebook is great for posts, but it&#x27;s hard to find on Google and you don&#x27;t control it. A website with your prices and contact details, linked to your Facebook and Google profile, works alongside it.</p></details>
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>Can you help me get more Google reviews?</summary><p>Yes. Every site and Google profile setup includes a review card with a QR code, so happy customers can leave a review in seconds.</p></details>
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>How does it work if we never meet?</summary><p>You tell us about your business on WhatsApp or the short form. We build a free mockup and send you the link to look at on your phone. If you like it, you get a fixed quote online, pay the R500 deposit by card, and we build and launch. If you&#x27;d like to talk, we do a quick video call.</p></details>
          <details class="faq__item"><summary>Is it the same price wherever I am?</summary><p>Yes. Websites start at R1,000 with a fixed quote before you pay anything, and hosting starts at R50 a month, anywhere in South Africa.</p></details>
        </div>
        <p class="small muted" style="margin-top:1.2rem">We also build for businesses in <a class="inline-link" href="website-design-johannesburg">Johannesburg</a> · <a class="inline-link" href="website-design-cape-town">Cape Town</a> · <a class="inline-link" href="website-design-durban">Durban</a> · <a class="inline-link" href="website-design-pretoria">Pretoria</a> · <a class="inline-link" href="website-design-gqeberha">Gqeberha</a> · <a class="inline-link" href="website-design-bloemfontein">Bloemfontein</a> · <a class="inline-link" href="website-design-polokwane">Polokwane</a>, and <a class="inline-link" href="website-design-south-africa">everywhere else in South Africa</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

